{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>האמללים</b> — Its cognate: כי אומלל אני. They are of the root of cutting and breaking of the body from excessive burden." "<b>היעזבו</b> — The first [form] is of the meaning of abandonment." "<b>היזבחו</b> — Like לזבח חנכת הבית, and the meaning is: they shall offer a sacrifice of dedication of the house." "<b>היכלו</b> — They shall complete their building on the appointed day that they estimate for completion." "<b>היחיו את האבנים</b> — For the burned stone is accounted as though dead."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:01.823960617Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}